Same:
    int: first
    int: second
    return: int
    test:
        return: first = second

Frequency:
    FxGroup@: group
    return: @
    row:
        return: (\group\key; length(group\items))

Example:
    int[]: items
    return: @
    run:
        throws: copy(FxThrows\traversal) SequenceElement
        return: map(groupBy(items; identity; Same\test); Frequency\row)
